"policy.LEGAL": [{"id":"terms","version":"2026-10","title":"Booking terms and ticket contract","statement":"I have read the booking terms and ticket contract, and I accept them for everyone on this booking.","body":["This is concept text for a demonstration, not a real contract.","The cruise fare, taxes and fees, and any package are due as shown at booking. A deposit holds the stateroom; the balance is due 90 days before sailing.","Itineraries, ports and times can change for weather, safety or operational reasons. When they do, we will tell you as soon as we can.","The cancellation and change terms shown before payment are part of this contract."]},{"id":"health","version":"2026-10","title":"Health requirements","statement":"I understand the health requirements, and I will tell Guest Services if anyone on this booking is unwell before sailing.","body":["Guests who have symptoms of an infectious illness before boarding may be asked to see the medical team, and may be refused boarding.","You must tell us about any medical equipment, such as oxygen or a CPAP machine, so we can plan for it. Bring enough of any medicine you take, in its original packaging.","Medical care on board is available, but it is not a hospital. Travel insurance that covers medical care and evacuation is strongly recommended."]},{"id":"age","version":"2026-10","title":"Minimum age","statement":"I confirm that every guest meets the minimum age, and that at least one guest in each stateroom is 21 or older on the day of sailing.","body":["Babies must be at least 6 months old on the first day of the cruise.","At least one guest in each stateroom must be 21 or older on the day of sailing. Guests under 18 must sail with an adult.","You will need to show proof of age for every guest at check-in."]},{"id":"pregnancy","version":"2026-10","title":"Pregnancy policy","statement":"I understand the pregnancy policy.","body":["A guest who will be 24 weeks pregnant or more at any time during the cruise cannot sail.","A guest who is pregnant must bring a note from their doctor that says they are fit to travel and gives the due date.","If you cannot sail because of this policy, tell us before you travel and ask Guest Services about your options."]}],
